{
  "id": "apply-twice",
  "title": {
    "tr": "İki Kez Uygula",
    "en": "Apply Twice"
  },
  "difficulty": 1,
  "language": "rust",
  "prompt": {
    "tr": "prompt.tr.md",
    "en": "prompt.en.md"
  },
  "starter": "starter.{lang}.rs",
  "solution": "solution.rs",
  "timeout_sec": 45,
  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "`f(f(value))`",
      "en": "`f(f(value))`"
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```rust\nfn apply_twice<F: Fn(i32) -> i32>(f: F, value: i32) -> i32 {\n    f(f(value))\n}\n\nfn main() {\n    println!(\"{}\", apply_twice(|x| x + 3, 1));\n}\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```rust\nfn apply_twice<F: Fn(i32) -> i32>(f: F, value: i32) -> i32 {\n    f(f(value))\n}\n\nfn main() {\n    println!(\"{}\", apply_twice(|x| x + 3, 1));\n}\n```"
    }
  ],
  "checks": [
    {
      "type": "rust_test",
      "tests": [
        {
          "code": "assert_eq!(apply_twice(|x| x + 3, 1), 7);",
          "label": {
            "tr": "toplama",
            "en": "adding"
          }
        },
        {
          "code": "assert_eq!(apply_twice(|x| x * x, 2), 16);",
          "label": {
            "tr": "kare",
            "en": "square"
          }
        },
        {
          "code": "let n = 10; assert_eq!(apply_twice(|x| x - n, 0), -20);",
          "label": {
            "tr": "yakalama",
            "en": "capture"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
